    "AnkiConnect is a free add-on that lets Tabbi count your due cards. It takes about a minute." : {
      "comment" : "Setup walkthrough or permission priming sheet in Settings > Connections.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnkiConnect ist eine kostenlose Erweiterung, mit der Tabbi deine fälligen Karten zählt. Das dauert etwa eine Minute."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnkiConnect es un complemento gratuito que permite a Tabbi contar tus tarjetas pendientes. Tarda un minuto más o menos."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ang AnkiConnect ay libreng add-on para mabilang ng Tabbi ang mga due card mo. Mga isang minuto lang ito."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnkiConnect est une extension gratuite qui permet à Tabbi de compter tes cartes à réviser. Ça prend environ une minute."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnkiConnectは、Tabbiが復習予定のカードを数えられるようにする無料のアドオンです。1分ほどで終わります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnkiConnect는 Tabbi가 복습할 카드를 셀 수 있게 해 주는 무료 부가 기능이에요. 1분 정도면 돼요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O AnkiConnect é um complemento gratuito que deixa o Tabbi contar seus cartões pendentes. Leva cerca de um minuto."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Бесплатное дополнение AnkiConnect позволяет Tabbi считать карточки к повторению. Это займет около минуты."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnkiConnect 是一个免费附加组件，可让 Tabbi 统计你待复习的卡片。大约需要一分钟。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AnkiConnect 是免費的附加元件，讓 Tabbi 能計算你待複習的卡片。大約需要一分鐘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AnkiConnect is set to ask for a key. Turning that off takes a minute." : {
