        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在「系統設定」中，開啟 Tabbi 下方的 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In [Shortcuts](shortcuts://), make “%@” with the Set Focus action turning Do Not Disturb on, and “%@” turning it off. Then press Test." : {
      "comment" : "Do Not Disturb setup guide. Keep the Markdown link; translate its text to the Shortcuts app's local name. The %@ are shortcut names. Test is the button label.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erstelle in [Kurzbefehle](shortcuts://) mit „Fokus festlegen“ „%@“ (Nicht stören an) und „%@“ (aus). Tippe dann auf Testen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En [Atajos](shortcuts://), crea “%@” (Definir concentración: No molestar activado) y “%@” (desactivado). Luego pulsa Probar."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sa [Shortcuts](shortcuts://), gumawa ng “%@” (Set Focus: Do Not Disturb on) at “%@” (off). Pagkatapos, pindutin ang Subukan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans [Raccourcis](shortcuts://), crée « %@ » (Définir la concentration : Ne pas déranger activé) et « %@ » (désactivé). Puis touche Tester."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[ショートカット](shortcuts://)の「集中モードを設定」で、おやすみモードをオンにする「%@」とオフにする「%@」を作り、テストを押します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[단축어](shortcuts://)에서 ‘집중 모드 설정’ 동작으로 방해금지 모드를 켜는 “%@”와 끄는 “%@”를 만든 다음 테스트를 누르세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No [Atalhos](shortcuts://), crie “%@” (Definir Foco: Não Perturbe ativado) e “%@” (desativado). Depois toque em Testar."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Создай в [Быстрых командах](shortcuts://) «%@» (вкл. «Не беспокоить») и «%@» (выкл.), затем нажми «Проверить»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在[快捷指令](shortcuts://)中，用“设定专注模式”操作创建打开勿扰模式的“%@”和关闭它的“%@”，然后点按测试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在[捷徑](shortcuts://)中，用「設定專注模式」動作建立開啟勿擾模式的「%@」和關閉它的「%@」，然後按「測試」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
