    "Only partly. Tabbi can add events but can't read them." : {
      "comment" : "Troubleshooter (Something not working?) in Settings > Connections: a yes-or-no check question or its short answer.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
