    "Spooky season is here. Focus to dress up your pet." : {
      "comment" : "Seasonal event tagline (Halloween).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gruselzeit! Mit Fokus verkleidest du dein Tier."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¡Sustos! Concéntrate y disfraza a tu mascota."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spooky season na. Mag-focus para bihisan ang pet mo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Frissons ! Concentre-toi pour déguiser ton ami."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ハロウィンの季節。集中してペットを仮装させよう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "으스스한 시즌이 왔어요. 집중해서 펫을 꾸며 봐요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chegou a temporada de sustos. Fantasie seu pet."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Время страшилок! Фокусируйся и наряжай питомца."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "万圣节来啦。专注一下,给宠物换装吧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "萬聖節到了。專注一下，幫寵物換裝吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify and Apple Music always show. For SoundCloud, macOS asks to let %@ control your browser, and the browser needs Allow JavaScript from Apple Events turned on." : {
      "comment" : "Now Playing settings footer. %@ is the app name. Allow JavaScript from Apple Events is the browser's Develop menu item; use the browser's local name for it.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify und Apple Music werden immer gezeigt. Für SoundCloud fragt macOS, ob %@ deinen Browser steuern darf, und im Browser muss „JavaScript von Apple Events erlauben“ an sein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify y Apple Music siempre se muestran. Para SoundCloud, macOS pide permiso para que %@ controle tu navegador, y el navegador necesita activar Permitir JavaScript desde Apple Events."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Laging lumalabas ang Spotify at Apple Music. Sa SoundCloud, papayagan mo ang %@ na kontrolin ang browser, at i-on doon ang Allow JavaScript from Apple Events."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify et Apple Music s'affichent toujours. Pour SoundCloud, macOS demande d'autoriser %@ à piloter ton navigateur, où il faut activer Autoriser JavaScript depuis les Apple Events."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SpotifyとApple Musicは常に表示されます。SoundCloudでは、macOSが%@によるブラウザの操作の許可を求めます。ブラウザで「AppleEventからのJavaScriptを許可」をオンにする必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify와 Apple Music은 항상 표시됩니다. SoundCloud는 macOS가 %@의 브라우저 제어 허용을 묻고, 브라우저에서 ‘Apple Events의 JavaScript 허용’을 켜야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify e Apple Music sempre aparecem. Para o SoundCloud, o macOS pede para deixar o %@ controlar seu navegador, e o navegador precisa de Permitir JavaScript de Apple Events ativado."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify и Apple Music показываются всегда. Для SoundCloud macOS попросит разрешить %@ управлять браузером, а в браузере нужно включить «Разрешить JavaScript из Apple Events»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify 和 Apple Music 始终显示。使用 SoundCloud 时，macOS 会询问是否允许 %@ 控制你的浏览器，且浏览器需打开“允许来自 Apple 事件的 JavaScript”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify 和 Apple Music 一律顯示。使用 SoundCloud 時，macOS 會詢問是否允許 %@ 控制你的瀏覽器，且瀏覽器需開啟「允許來自 Apple 事件的 JavaScript」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
