    "To attach your screen, turn on Tabbi under Screen Recording. The screenshot goes only to %@ with your question." : {
      "comment" : "Ask AI: permission card text; %@ is the AI name (Claude, Gemini...).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
